{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-06","example":{"issue":{"title":"斜交角度小，轉向與視距是否足夠？","intro":"主要道路約 20 m、次要道路約 6 m，主要道路另有機慢車道。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-06-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"主次道路提示不足","text":"主要道路缺少提醒駕駛留意路口來車的警示。"},{"id":"turn","title":"轉向與機慢車交織","text":"路口前缺少左右轉空間，右轉汽車與機慢車容易交織。"},{"id":"visibility","title":"斜交影響觀察視距","text":"次要道路斜交角度小，駕駛觀察主要道路來車較困難。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[71,72],"strategy":{"title":"調整斜交角度，分開轉向空間","intro":"讓次要道路容易觀察來車，並為主要道路轉向車流安排等待位置。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-06-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"angle","title":"調整巷道接近角度","text":"讓次要道路以接近直角的方式銜接主要道路，改善停等時的觀察條件。","moduleId":"M2-01"},{"id":"turn","title":"分開左轉與直右車流","text":"主要道路配置左轉車道與直右車道，減少轉向等待對直行的干擾。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"continuity","title":"讓車道銜接更清楚","text":"配合車道線、快慢車道分隔線與速限提示，整理進出路口的行進範圍。","moduleId":"M4-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-06-unsignalized-rural-skewed-t.typ","sha256":"5b7389ee42ffe730ee30a7795e20f834bb78be14fe8c4103b9a99f7743ee84d8","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g1-06-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況圖_01.png","width":2414,"height":2637,"label":"G1-06 現況圖","scenario":"G1-06","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":71,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image82.png","sha256":"61c6156aa7895f17ea3a2773e3e8168353e09e757cdd3ecc29eb8c941d96c63d"},"results:g1-06-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況照片_01.png","width":2498,"height":1389,"label":"G1-06 現況照片","scenario":"G1-06","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":72,"sourcePart":"ppt/medi